{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-106603","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-171758","text":"RuneFort Interactive Layer — Build Order"}]},{"id":"blk-106604","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-171759","text":"Overview"}]},{"id":"blk-106605","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171760","text":"Six prompts that transform RuneFort from a static fort visualizer into an interactive playground with BYOK chat, MCP tool connections, token flow animations, repo import, and workspace management."}]},{"id":"blk-106606","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-171761","text":"Dependency Graph"}]},{"id":"blk-106607","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"RFORT-1 (BYOK) ──────┐\n                      ├── RFORT-3 (Chat) ── RFORT-4 (Token Flows)\nRFORT-2 (MCP) ───────┘\nRFORT-5 (Repo Import) ── standalone, uses fort generator\nRFORT-6 (Workspaces) ── standalone, uses auth + supabase"},{"id":"blk-106608","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-171762","text":"Recommended Session Plan"}]},{"id":"blk-106609","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-171763","text":"Session A: Foundation (RFORT-1 + RFORT-2)"}]},{"id":"blk-106610","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171764","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-171765","text":": \"Build RFORT-1 and RFORT-2. Read "},{"id":"spn-171766","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-1_BYOK.md"},{"id":"spn-171767","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-171768","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-2_MCP.md"},{"id":"spn-171769","text":" for full specs. These are the foundation — BYOK key storage and MCP proxy/client. Port patterns from "},{"id":"spn-171770","marks":["code"],"text":"bendscript.com/src/lib/play/"},{"id":"spn-171771","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-171772","marks":["code"],"text":"bendscript.com/src/routes/api/play/mcp-proxy/"},{"id":"spn-171773","text":". Verify: API key modal opens, key persists in localStorage, MCP proxy forwards to graphonomous-mcp.fly.dev, tool discovery returns tools.\""}]},{"id":"blk-106611","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-171774","text":"Session B: Chat (RFORT-3)"}]},{"id":"blk-106612","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171775","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-171776","text":": \"Build RFORT-3. Read "},{"id":"spn-171777","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-3_CHAT.md"},{"id":"spn-171778","text":" for full spec. Add the chat panel with tool-use loop. The chat should use the BYOK OpenRouter key (from RFORT-1), call MCP tools via the proxy (from RFORT-2), and execute built-in fort navigation tools that zoom/navigate the fort view. Verify: chat sends messages via OpenRouter, tool calls work (both MCP and built-in), fort navigation tools zoom the view.\""}]},{"id":"blk-106613","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-171779","text":"Session C: Token Flows (RFORT-4)"}]},{"id":"blk-106614","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171780","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-171781","text":": \"Build RFORT-4. Read "},{"id":"spn-171782","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-4_TOKENFLOWS.md"},{"id":"spn-171783","text":" for full spec. Add animated particles on Svelte Flow edges representing token throughput. Include a benchmark simulation mode that cascades flows through PULSE phases. Verify: particles animate along edges, speed/color respond to metrics, simulation runs through all phases.\""}]},{"id":"blk-106615","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-171784","text":"Session D: Repo Import (RFORT-5)"}]},{"id":"blk-106616","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171785","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-171786","text":": \"Build RFORT-5. Read "},{"id":"spn-171787","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-5_REPO_IMPORT.md"},{"id":"spn-171788","text":" for full spec. Add GitHub repo import that converts repository structure into a fort. Directories → rooms, files → tiles, package manifests → gates. Verify: paste a GitHub URL, import generates a navigable fort, zoom works on imported fort.\""}]},{"id":"blk-106617","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-171789","text":"Session E: Workspaces (RFORT-6)"}]},{"id":"blk-106618","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171790","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-171791","text":": \"Build RFORT-6. Read "},{"id":"spn-171792","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-6_WORKSPACES.md"},{"id":"spn-171793","text":" for full spec. Add workspace switching tied to amp.workspaces. Each workspace shows its own district of saved forts. Verify: workspace dropdown shows user's workspaces, switching reloads forts, demo mode works without auth.\""}]},{"id":"blk-106619","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-171794","text":"Context for All Sessions"}]},{"id":"blk-106620","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-106622","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171795","marks":["bold"],"text":"Framework"},{"id":"spn-171796","text":": SvelteKit 2.x + Svelte 5 (runes: "},{"id":"spn-171797","marks":["code"],"text":"$state"},{"id":"spn-171798","text":", "},{"id":"spn-171799","marks":["code"],"text":"$props"},{"id":"spn-171800","text":", "},{"id":"spn-171801","marks":["code"],"text":"$effect"},{"id":"spn-171802","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-106621","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-106624","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171803","marks":["bold"],"text":"Flow lib"},{"id":"spn-171804","text":": "},{"id":"spn-171805","marks":["code"],"text":"@xyflow/svelte"},{"id":"spn-171806","text":" v1.5.0"}]}],"id":"blk-106623","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-106626","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171807","marks":["bold"],"text":"Style"},{"id":"spn-171808","text":": Dark theme, zinc-900 bg, amber-400 accents"}]}],"id":"blk-106625","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-106628","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171809","marks":["bold"],"text":"SSR"},{"id":"spn-171810","text":": Disabled on "},{"id":"spn-171811","marks":["code"],"text":"/app"},{"id":"spn-171812","text":" route ("},{"id":"spn-171813","marks":["code"],"text":"export const ssr = false"},{"id":"spn-171814","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-106627","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-106630","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171815","marks":["bold"],"text":"Supabase"},{"id":"spn-171816","text":": Lazy client via "},{"id":"spn-171817","marks":["code"],"text":"getSupabase()"},{"id":"spn-171818","text":" (returns null during SSR)"}]}],"id":"blk-106629","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-106632","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171819","marks":["bold"],"text":"Existing code"},{"id":"spn-171820","text":": Marketing site + 5-level fort editor already built (see "},{"id":"spn-171821","marks":["code"],"text":"src/"},{"id":"spn-171822","text":" tree)"}]}],"id":"blk-106631","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-106634","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171823","marks":["bold"],"text":"BendScript reference"},{"id":"spn-171824","text":": The "},{"id":"spn-171825","marks":["code"],"text":"/play"},{"id":"spn-171826","text":" implementation in "},{"id":"spn-171827","marks":["code"],"text":"bendscript.com/"},{"id":"spn-171828","text":" is the proven pattern to port from"}]}],"id":"blk-106633","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaierane4jvlv4yzst77psj4regy2aii4uqkuslsjxi4ufumsov2zsbvvq","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}